    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"stop the fall\"... what does that even mean? how do you stop a crash that's already happening? it feels like everyone is just watching me hit the ground. i just feel so much shame. if i could just... if i could just find a way to not have to face the bottom, maybe it wouldnt be so bad. i just dont want to be known as the failure who lost everything.",
